    "text": "模板装配 SQL：\nSELECT w.well_id AS 井号, w.block_name AS 区块, SUM(m.oil_output) AS 日产油量合计（吨）\nFROM agg.fct_daily_metering m\n  JOIN agg.dim_well w ON w.well_id = m.well_id\n  JOIN agg.dim_date d ON d.date = m.prod_date\nWHERE m.prod_date >= '2025-01-01' AND m.prod_date < '2026-01-01'\nGROUP BY w.well_id, w.block_name\nORDER BY SUM(m.oil_output) DESC\nLIMIT 50"
